-- תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה, פרק 6, §6.21 בי"ס ימי/חקלאי
-- A teacher in a post-primary maritime or agricultural school is under the
-- same rules as one in a primary maritime or agricultural school (§3.19.7).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `6.21 בי"ס ימי/חקלאי`

@desc The kinds of school §6.21 speaks of.
DECLARE `maritime or agricultural school level` IS ONE OF
    `primary maritime or agricultural school`
    `post-primary maritime or agricultural school`

-- §3.19.7 is not encoded yet, so whether one of its rules is met is a
-- named input here, not a copy of it.
@desc Whether the rule of section 3.19.7 (a teacher in a primary maritime or agricultural school) that is being asked about is met; an input until 3.19.7 is encoded.
ASSUME `the rule of 3.19.7 is met for a primary maritime or agricultural school teacher` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_21__hc_2/p1 akn:chp_6__sec_6_21__hc_2/p2
GIVEN `level` IS A `maritime or agricultural school level`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the rule of 3.19.7 applies to a teacher at` `level` IF
    CONSIDER `level`
    WHEN `primary maritime or agricultural school`      THEN TRUE
    WHEN `post-primary maritime or agricultural school` THEN TRUE

GIVEN `level` IS A `maritime or agricultural school level`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the teacher meets the rule` `level` IF
        `the rule of 3.19.7 applies to a teacher at` `level`
    AND `the rule of 3.19.7 is met for a primary maritime or agricultural school teacher`

-- The two levels are decided alike: whatever 3.19.7 gives the primary
-- teacher, it gives the post-primary one.
`both levels are decided alike` MEANS
    `the rule of 3.19.7 applies to a teacher at` `post-primary maritime or agricultural school`
        EQUALS `the rule of 3.19.7 applies to a teacher at` `primary maritime or agricultural school`
#ASSERT `both levels are decided alike`
